# KReady: environment variables
#
# None are required. The app uses only key-free APIs (Open-Meteo, Frankfurter),
# so there are no API keys or secrets to set, locally or on Vercel.
#
# NODE_ENV is set automatically by Next.js (development / production).
#
# If a key-based API is added later, list its variable name here (never a value),
# put the real value in .env.local (git-ignored) and in the Vercel project settings,
# and read it only in server code (src/lib/server or src/app/api).
